	(text "VOUT = VFB x (1 + 147k / (6.98k + RV1)) + IFB x 147k:\n25.83 V at RV1 = 500 ... 27.59 V at RV1 = 0; 27.2 V needs about 105 ohm.\nRV1 is a fail-safe rheostat (pin 3 to R3, pins 1+2 to GND):\nclockwise RAISES the bias. Start fully counter-clockwise."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
